menu "Spreadtrum and Unisoc SoC drivers"

config SPRD_AGDSP
	tristate "Audio DSP support"
	depends on ARCH_SPRD || COMPILE_TEST
	depends on MAILBOX
	help
	  Say y here to enable support for communication with the audio
	  DSP found in Spreadtrum/Unisoc SoCs.

config SPRD_AUDCP_BOOT
	tristate "Audio DSP (AUDCP) boot support"
	depends on ARCH_SPRD || COMPILE_TEST
	help
	  Say y here to load firmware into and boot the audio co-processor
	  (AUDCP / AGDSP) on Spreadtrum/Unisoc SoCs, so the sprd-agdsp IPC
	  and ASoC audio stack can communicate with it.

endmenu
